


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_54158645:


    "晚饭后的闲暇时光。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_2df2835d:


    "但是气氛并没有平时那么闲适，感觉有些紧张。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_e1abc2b6:



    voice "2HI_0450"
    hina "「考试考试……考试之后还是考试……我们到底为了什么活着……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_a6d6fd40:


    "阳菜一边嘀咕着什么夸张的话一边看着笔记。她就是紧张气氛的始作俑者。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_3a9bfd23:


    "这幅光景以前也见到过。步步逼近的实力测试备考当中。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_df5c3807:



    voice "2HI_0451"
    hina "「摸底考试比期中和期末考试性质还恶劣」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_0bdabf40:



    voice "2RI_0480"
    rin "「为什么～？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_bdc7902c:


    "桌子下面传来了一个有气无力的声音。是依旧考试无忧的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_e51e966f:



    voice "2HI_0452"
    hina "「范围太广了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d773324a:



    voice "2FU_0411"
    fumi "「毕竟要考第一学期和第二学期的全部内容呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_f486fda8:


    "文抓起从教科书封面到考试范围的页数亮了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_76d4b683:



    voice "2HI_0453"
    hina "「这不就是全部吗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_a6e842b9:



    voice "2RI_0481"
    rin "「这种啊～还是要靠平日里的积累哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d7aa29be:



    voice "2HI_0454"
    hina "「被只知道躺在床上的人这么说，我真的气得不行」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_366e7e40:



    voice "2MI_0318"
    miyako "「那个，可以问个问题吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_6c436c66:


    "在抄笔记的圣夜子向原作者开口询问。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_70d9d3bb:



    voice "2MI_0319"
    miyako "「这里，写的是源义经在奥州衣川一战里自杀了，但是没有后续了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_69370e26:



    voice "2FU_0412"
    fumi "「那个，后续是？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_310ed09a:


    "指着笔记上相应的地方询问的圣夜子和一脸不解的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_92283620:



    voice "2RI_0482"
    rin "「其实他幸存了下来，然后从虾夷地区渡海去了大陆，成为了成吉思汗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_599336a7:



    voice "2MI_0320"
    miyako "「那个——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_5759763d:



    voice "2HI_0455"
    hina "「啊，真的吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_b0e8f778:



    voice "2RI_0483"
    rin "「不，只是传说，传承，流传下来的说法，从学术角度来说就是胡说八道啦。从历史资料来看就知道不可能吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_c0ed75e7:


    "伦合上书，站了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_60635afa:



    voice "2RI_0484"
    rin "「有时候想都不想就开起玩笑了。这样不行呢，有笨蛋会当真的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_84132bd5:



    voice "2HI_0456"
    hina "「喂！别想都不想就说啊！看我这边！不对，别看！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_870fc5fa:



    voice "2MI_0321"
    miyako "「但其实——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d13a6680:


    "说到一半好像是察觉到了什么，圣夜子闭上了嘴。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_a62c9371:


    "大概那才是正解。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_597e54ab:


    "——是看到了吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_32ba9aad:



    voice "2FU_0413"
    fumi "「那个，没事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_b07e3a23:



    voice "2MI_0322"
    miyako "「没事。不好意思说了奇怪的话。话说，文同学的笔记很容易懂呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_12117d9e:



    voice "2RI_0485"
    rin "「很不错吧，文的笔记。只要有了这个笔记就相当于是赢了。甚至想拿去复印然后在小卖部里出售了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_4b9f28fe:



    voice "2FU_0414"
    fumi "「……太羞耻了请别这样做」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_5efb97ba:



    voice "2RI_0486"
    rin "「啊，这里用彩色笔区别开来的地方很重要，抄写的时候一定要做标记——哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_03fdc0a8:


    "伦看到圣夜子的笔记僵住了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_961ccfa0:



    voice "2FU_0415"
    fumi "「嗯，怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_b57a250c:



    voice "2RI_0487"
    rin "「不，那个，就是觉得圣夜夜写的字真有个性啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_cf85745c:



    voice "2MI_0323"
    miyako "「哈哈，我写得不好。文同学的字很好看，放在一起就很显眼」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_9f91b14c:


    "圣夜子很难为情地挠了挠头发。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_4f5057d3:


    "她的笔记里的字，与其说是有个性……不如说是幼稚。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_60277b76:



    voice "2MI_0324"
    miyako "「我还不是很习惯。看和做是两回事啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_eaaa06e8:



    voice "2HI_0457"
    hina "「说得好像自己最近才会写字一样啊。因为是归国子女吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_87553721:



    voice "2FU_0416"
    fumi "「明明口语就很流畅，真是不可思议呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_769f0cc0:



    voice "2MI_0325"
    miyako "「啊哈哈，我会练习的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_e1153064:



    voice "2HI_0458"
    hina "「啊！你在干啥」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_176dce86:


    "阳菜突然开口说道。伦拿起了她的笔记。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_13639aba:



    voice "2RI_0488"
    rin "「我在看你学得怎么样了。这是英语？你写的还是这么潦草啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_9904c30b:


    "确实写得满满的。总之写下来记住算是阳菜的学习方法。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d30e1714:



    voice "2RI_0489"
    rin "「……呵呵！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_eed961fa:


    "翻看笔记的伦突然笑喷了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_8ffd3948:



    voice "2HI_0459"
    hina "「喂，别看着别人的笔记大笑！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_c1672fc0:



    voice "2RI_0490"
    rin "「哈哈哈哈！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_fbb2bcfc:


    "笑到这种地步确实有失礼貌。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_4250eab1:



    voice "2RI_0491"
    rin "「毕竟“宇宙空间”被翻译成“space space”了哦？意译也是有个限度的吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d74790e8:


    "一般都译作“outer space”吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_7e833418:



    voice "2HI_0460"
    hina "「烦死了烦死了！把笔记还我！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_2e6b9f6f:



    voice "2RI_0492"
    rin "「不，我还想好好看看。这种槽点满满的笔记世间可不多见啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_e65d9aa6:



    voice "2HI_0461"
    hina "「槽点满满，你真敢说！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_6e475fb1:


    "飞扑过来准备抢回笔记的阳菜，和利用手长而不交出来的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_58a2d0a7:



    voice "2FU_0417"
    fumi "「圣夜子，文科和理科你会选择哪个？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_84df478b:


    "胡闹已经是家常便饭了，所以即使旁边在闹来闹去，文依旧我行我素。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_27685975:



    voice "2MI_0326"
    miyako "「怎么说呢，看考试的情况吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d6dac213:



    voice "2FU_0418"
    fumi "「看考试情况……是吗。没有什么对将来的展望吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_fdcd6492:



    voice "2MI_0327"
    miyako "「嗯～我还什么都不懂，抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_1f2874b0:



    voice "2FU_0419"
    fumi "「没关系，我觉得不用着急的。慢慢找吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_521b095b:



    voice "2MI_0328"
    miyako "「谢谢你。但是一想到将来，就觉得好兴奋呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_5ccd1c7b:


    "是吗。对至今为止生活在永恒的时间里，没有现在、过去、未来概念的她来说是很新鲜的想法。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_806af081:



    voice "2FU_0420"
    fumi "「我懂。烦恼的过程也是一种快乐吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_b685acae:



    voice "2MI_0329"
    miyako "「文同学已经想好了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_bdcb0c74:



    voice "2FU_0421"
    fumi "「我小时候就想，要是能做制作点心的工作就好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_5f40451e:



    voice "2MI_0330"
    miyako "「原来如此。那是文科？还是理科？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_00c4780a:



    voice "2FU_0422"
    fumi "「……算、算哪种呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_0a282811:



    voice "2SA_0187"
    sachiko "「喂—洗澡水，已经烧好了哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_5d80d6f6:


    "啊，是祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_2f5c80d7:



    voice "2HI_0462"
    hina "「啊，你又没敲门就进来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_56de8b2e:



    voice "2SA_0188"
    sachiko "「我·敲·门·了。都怪你们太闹腾了所以没听到。你们闹腾的声音走廊里都能听到哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_fedcc708:



    voice "2FU_0423"
    fumi "「对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_7ae9cd23:



    voice "2SA_0189"
    sachiko "「小文不用道歉的。这栋楼很破了，所以就算地板塌了我也不会管的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_6512ff43:



    voice "2RI_0493"
    rin "「错不在我」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_172f429d:


    "伦指着阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_0ec3a356:



    voice "2HI_0463"
    hina "「我又没错」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_3d3a4b96:


    "阳菜指着伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d788f1f3:



    voice "2MI_0331"
    miyako "「我也没有错……吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_4b3b9247:


    "圣夜子胆胆怯怯地举起手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_6bee5a14:



    voice "2SA_0190"
    sachiko "「啊～好了好了。我还要去其他房间，你们想第一个去洗澡就快点准备了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_a5bced3d:



    voice "2FU_0424"
    fumi "「哇～我为了今天新买了洗澡用品哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_6fca5179:


    "文好像已经准备好了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_0d724d69:



    voice "2SA_0191"
    sachiko "「你们也快点。我等会也去」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_8f4899e6:


    "若无其事地说了一句。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_d0971871:


    hina_rin "「你不用来！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_4fe3a55a:



    voice "2SA_0192"
    sachiko "「切。那你们洗完了来我的房间报告下」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_50f42817:



    voice "2FU_0425"
    fumi "「我明白了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_e299d608:



    voice "2SA_0193"
    sachiko "「啊，对了。之前提过的火锅派对，明天晚上办哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_64b0c874:


    hina_rin_fumi_miyako "「好～」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_7792739a:


    voice "2RI_0485"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_04_238fd090:


    rin "「很不错吧，文的笔记。只要有了这个笔记就相当于是赢了。甚至想拿去复印然后在小卖部里出售了」"
